FAISLA
======================================================================
  Dekhna ye hai ki upar kisi jawab me KLIFS position (1-85) aur
  residue number DONO ek saath aaye hain ya nahi. Agar nahi, to
  pocket sequence ko UniProt sequence se align karna padega -
  wo ho sakta hai (pocket kuch contiguous tukdon ka jod hai), par
  wo alag kaam hai aur uski apni jaanch chahiye.
